<BaseLayout title="7 Careless Mistakes That Cost O-Level Maths Marks | A-Worthy" description="The 7 method and careless mistakes that quietly cost O-Level Maths (4052) marks — and the SHARP framework fix for each, from method selection to 'show that' proofs." ogImage="/images/og-maths.png">
